// seizures, and other mimics by history; naming seizures in ILAE 2017 terms and applying the 2014
// practical definition of epilepsy; and the first seizure: provoking causes, EEG and MRI, the
// treatment decision, and safety advice. Status epilepticus belongs to c-status-epilepticus.

